# 11 bytes, for testing caching algorithm
#
# When loaded into cache, 11 bytes should be loaded, and read status
# will be non-zero because MACPTR could not give us the 256 bytes we
# asked for.  But those 11 should be available in the cache.

AA       #  8-bit value
33221100 # 32-bit value
665544   # 24-bit value
8877     # 16-bit value
99       #  8-bit value
